        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_13"/>
        <dc:title>Web Application Penetration Testing</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>This paper describes the in-depth technical approach to perform manual penetration test in web applications for testing the integrity and security of the application and also serves as a guide to test OWASP top 10 security vulnerabilities. The paper is more focused on providing detailed knowledge about manual web application penetration testing methodologies in order to secure them from malicious black hat hackers.</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>2019-08-30</dc:date>
